          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "SEM micrographs giving a cross-sectional view of the molded part for the foamed COC as well as COC/CB3 and COC/cCF10 are shown in Figure 3."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "P_2_41",
          "page": 2,
          "bbox": [
            506.0,
            686.0,
            900.0,
            793.0
          ],
          "source_type": "text",
          "source_sentence": "Comparing SEM micrographs of the foamed and nonfoamed COC/ CB3, as seen in Figure 4, there was no detectable difference in CB dispersion caused by the foaming agent."
        },
        {
          "block_id": "I_3_48",
          "page": 3,
          "bbox": [
            106.0,
            630.0,
